### Order Management API — contoh request
### Jalankan API dulu: dotnet run --project src/OrderManagement.Api
### Bisa dieksekusi langsung dari VS Code (REST Client) / Visual Studio / Rider.
### Jalankan request "login" dulu; token-nya otomatis dipakai request berikutnya.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5155
@productX = a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@indomie = a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002
@aqua = a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@salesToken = {{loginSales.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Login sebagai admin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Login sebagai sales
# @name loginSales
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "sales", "password": "Sales123!" }

### Password salah -> 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "salah" }

### Tanpa token -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### User yang sedang login
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Produk

### Lihat produk & stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tambah produk (Admin)
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gula Pasir 1kg", "price": 17500, "stockQuantity": 40, "isActive": true }

### Ubah nama / harga / status aktif (stock tidak ikut berubah)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gula Pasir Premium 1kg", "price": 18500, "isActive": true }

### Barang masuk: tambah stock 25 (atomic)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}/stock-adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 25, "reason": "Barang masuk dari supplier" }

### Kurangi stock melebihi persediaan -> 409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}/stock-adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": -1000 }

### Sales tidak boleh menambah produk -> 403 FORBIDDEN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Produk Sales", "price": 1000, "stockQuantity": 1 }

### Hapus produk (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- Order

### Buat order (Idempotency-Key wajib, X-Correlation-ID opsional)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-demo-001
X-Correlation-ID: demo-trace-001

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "shippingAddress": "Jl. Asia Afrika No. 1, Bandung",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{indomie}}", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "{{aqua}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Retry dengan key yang sama -> order yang sama, header Idempotent-Replayed: true, stock tidak terpotong lagi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-demo-001

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "shippingAddress": "Jl. Asia Afrika No. 1, Bandung",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{indomie}}", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "{{aqua}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Key sama, payload beda -> 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-demo-001

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "shippingAddress": "Alamat lain",
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{indomie}}", "quantity": 99 } ]
}

### Stock tidak cukup -> 409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-demo-002

{
  "customerId": "CUST-002",
  "shippingAddress": "Jl. Braga No. 10, Bandung",
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{productX}}", "quantity": 100 } ]
}

### Validasi -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-demo-003

{ "customerId": "", "items": [ { "productId": "{{indomie}}", "quantity": 0 } ] }

### Detail order (ETag = version)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List order dengan filter + pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?customerId=CUST-001&status=Pending&from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sales tidak boleh mengubah status -> 403 FORBIDDEN
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Confirmed" }

### Update status oleh admin (optimistic lock via expectedVersion)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Confirmed", "expectedVersion": 1 }

### Version basi -> 409 VERSION_MISMATCH (bisa juga lewat header If-Match)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{ "status": "Shipped" }

### Transisi tidak valid -> 422 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Delivered" }

### Cancel -> stock dikembalikan (Admin maupun Sales)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Health check (tanpa token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
